## Part 3: Step-Wise Implementation Plan

### Phase 0: Pre-Work & Infrastructure (Days 1–3)

> Prerequisite setup before any code changes.

- [ ] **0.1** Set up Redis locally and on server; configure `QUEUE_CONNECTION=redis` in [.env](file:///Users/bien/Downloads/pisti-app/.env)
- [ ] **0.2** Install & configure Laravel Horizon (`composer require laravel/horizon`)
- [ ] **0.3** Obtain wildcard SSL certificate for `*.pisti.co.ke` via Let's Encrypt:
  ```bash
  certbot certonly --manual --preferred-challenges dns -d "*.pisti.co.ke" -d "pisti.co.ke"
  ```
- [ ] **0.4** Configure Nginx with wildcard subdomain routing:
  ```nginx
  server_name *.pisti.co.ke pisti.co.ke;
  ```
- [ ] **0.5** Set up staging environment subdomain: `churchname.pisti.co.ke` for safe testing
- [ ] **0.6** Take full database backup of production

