### Phase 4: Full Data Migration — All 70 Tables (Days 12–18)

> The most mechanical phase. Add `tenant_id` to all remaining tables and apply the trait.

**Grouped migration batches:**

- [ ] **4.1** People tables: `contacts`, `scontacts`, `emergency_contact`, `church`, `families`, `professions`, `education`, `profiles`, `profile_categories`
- [ ] **4.2** Finance tables: `funds`, `sources`, `pledges`, `pledge_sms`, `assets`, `donations`, `budget`, `budget_items`, `activities`, `summaries`, `summaries_operations`, `ModeOfPayment`
- [ ] **4.3** Communication tables: `sms`, `sms_recipients`, `emails`, `email_recipients`, `schedules`, `twilios`
- [ ] **4.4** Events tables: `events`, `notices`, `seminars`, `attendance`, `attendance_groups`, `registration`
- [ ] **4.5** Spiritual tables: `sermons`, `prayers`, `testimonials`
- [ ] **4.6** People Groups: `communities`, `departments`, `people`, `people_members`, `participants`, `groups`, `pastors`
- [ ] **4.7** Content: `articles`, `article_categories`, `article_tags`, `galleries`, `home_pages`, `pastorsmessage`, `orderofservice`, `weeklyverse`, `media_folders`, `media_files`
- [ ] **4.8** Shop: `products`, `purchases`
- [ ] **4.9** Settings/Tags: `tags`, `tag_user`, `birthday_settings`, `sunday_school_classes`, `residences`, `mpesa_message_settings`
- [ ] **4.10** Mpesa: `mpesa_transactions`, `mpesa_phones`, `missing_mpesa_phones`
- [ ] **4.11** Spatie auth: `roles`, `permissions`, `model_has_roles`, `model_has_permissions`, `role_has_permissions`
- [ ] **4.12** Apply `BelongsToTenant` trait to ALL corresponding models
- [ ] **4.13** Audit all `DB::table()` and `DB::select()` raw queries — add manual `where('tenant_id', tenant()->id)` scoping:
  ```bash
  grep -rn "DB::table\|DB::select\|DB::statement" app/Http/Controllers/ --include="*.php"
